      "observation": "Registered Clone revives original capability, gets detached compound, replaces destination-owned capability only when nonempty, invalidates original; respawn/changeDimension/login sync separately. Provider invalidation replaces LazyOptional while retaining lazy NBT. getCopy deep-copies NBT; copyFrom clears own keys before merge. Packet targets current local player, not arbitrary entity.",
      "limits": [
        "No try/finally around revive/invalidate; no proof exception always cleans capabilities.",
        "If old compound empty, destination defaults are left intact; not unconditional replace-empty semantics.",
        "Mantle transport thread implementation not cached/read in this batch; handler naming is not thread guarantee.",
        "Dynasty root fields are not capabilities; reviveCaps is unnecessary for direct root tags."
      ]
